      "type": "text",
      "text": "Complete three upper-division language courses in one Asian language offered by the department."
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Complete eight upper-division electives within the department, including at least one course from at least four of the following areas: Asia, China, Japan, Korea, South Asia, or Southeast Asia."
